{"id":"662124","name":"自制奶酪棒","author":"圆小π","authorId":"1365842","desc":"","cover":"images/662124/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"纯牛奶","amount":"85g"}],"sub":[{"name":"芝士","amount":"1片16g"},{"name":"吉利丁片","amount":"1片6g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备材料。","img":"images/662124/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"吉利丁片放入冷水中泡5分钟。","img":"images/662124/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"牛奶倒入锅中，小火加热，放入糖和芝士搅拌融化。","img":"images/662124/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"泡软的吉利丁片捞出来控一下水份。","img":"images/662124/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"牛奶五六十度的时候加入，搅拌融化。","img":"images/662124/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"过滤后倒入模具。","img":"images/662124/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入冰箱冷藏2个小时。","img":"images/662124/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"脱模了，好吃又健康，做法零难度。","img":"images/662124/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}